data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-thinking-parallel_evidence-1633", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "**。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789390841438, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-thinking-parallel_evidence-1634", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（本轮 e1–e4 + baseline）\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 | 与\"NotReady\"的关系 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **K8s Describe** | Pod Phase=Running；Container app Ready=False；Readiness=`http-get :18081/ready` delay=5s timeout=1s period=5s #success=1 #failure=1 | Probe 配置指向 **端口 18081** 路径 `/ready` |\n| **K8s YAML** | 应用 command 打印 `listening on 18080`，实际监听 **18080** 端口，且 GET `/health` 才返回 200；无 `/ready` 端点 | Probe 端口(path port=18081 vs listen 18080)与路径(/ready vs /health)均不匹配 |\n| **Logs (kubectl)** | 仅一行 `listening on 18080`；进程确实在", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789390841480, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "seq": 1635, "ts_ms": 1789390849254, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 41.08, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v16", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a527546ecfec4736-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "4442ac86c9c2e7a8ded929dbe517df4fc35f11c8850876e7346c1b3bf2e10f1f", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "1608255ed6c82f8b4e34273248c24c57396d84ce92988cbc6ec10ff83d3c3fa0"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "seq": 1636, "ts_ms": 1789390849255, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "seq": 1637, "ts_ms": 1789390856296, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.042, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1187, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-v16/workload status is NotReady due to Readiness Probe failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`: Ready=True(ContainersNotReady) | 描述 Pod 当前处于非就绪状态的具体症状。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Readiness probe failed: Get \\\"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\\\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused\" | 暴露 Kubelet 尝试连接探针端口 `18081` 并遭遇网络拒绝的事实。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 (container=app) | 确认应用容器并未发生 OOM 等异常重启，排除了应用崩溃。 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nMetric 维度的重启数为 0 排除了应用进程崩溃导致启动失败的可能。K8s Event 记录了端口 `18081` 的连接被拒绝，结合 K8s State 的持续未就绪状态，将问题定位在端口与路径的连通性配置上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness Probe 配置目标为端口 18081 路径 /ready → 容器应用实际监听端口 18080 路径 /health → 探针发起连接遭拒绝 (dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused) → Pod 状态变为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：探针端口/路径配置与应用实际监听端口/路径不匹配（证据 #2）。Kubelet 在 `18081/ready` 端口执行探测时，由于该端口未被应用监听，导致 TCP 连接被拒绝，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainersNotReady` 状态（证据 #1）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-v16/workload status is NotReady due to Readiness Probe failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`: Ready=True(ContainersNotReady) | 描述 Pod 当前处于非就绪状态的具体症状。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Readiness probe failed: Get \\\"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\\\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused\" | 暴露 Kubelet 尝试连接探针端口 `18081` 并遭遇网络拒绝的事实。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 (container=app) | 确认应用容器并未发生 OOM 等异常重启，排除了应用崩溃。 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nMetric 维度的重启数为 0 排除了应用进程崩溃导致启动失败的可能。K8s Event 记录了端口 `18081` 的连接被拒绝，结合 K8s State 的持续未就绪状态，将问题定位在端口与路径的连通性配置上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness Probe 配置目标为端口 18081 路径 /ready → 容器应用实际监听端口 18080 路径 /health → 探针发起连接遭拒绝 (dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused) → Pod 状态变为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：探针端口/路径配置与应用实际监听端口/路径不匹配（证据 #2）。Kubelet 在 `18081/ready` 端口执行探测时，由于该端口未被应用监听，导致 TCP 连接被拒绝，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainersNotReady` 状态（证据 #1）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "a527546ecfec4736-final", "run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "seq": 1639, "ts_ms": 1789390856314, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-v16/workload status is NotReady due to Readiness Probe failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`: Ready=True(ContainersNotReady) | 描述 Pod 当前处于非就绪状态的具体症状。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Readiness probe failed: Get \\\"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\\\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused\" | 暴露 Kubelet 尝试连接探针端口 `18081` 并遭遇网络拒绝的事实。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 (container=app) | 确认应用容器并未发生 OOM 等异常重启，排除了应用崩溃。 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nMetric 维度的重启数为 0 排除了应用进程崩溃导致启动失败的可能。K8s Event 记录了端口 `18081` 的连接被拒绝，结合 K8s State 的持续未就绪状态，将问题定位在端口与路径的连通性配置上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness Probe 配置目标为端口 18081 路径 /ready → 容器应用实际监听端口 18080 路径 /health → 探针发起连接遭拒绝 (dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused) → Pod 状态变为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：探针端口/路径配置与应用实际监听端口/路径不匹配（证据 #2）。Kubelet 在 `18081/ready` 端口执行探测时，由于该端口未被应用监听，导致 TCP 连接被拒绝，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainersNotReady` 状态（证据 #1）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v16/workload: 41.1s (Evidence 33.4s, RCA 7.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v16/workload**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.742, "metrics": {"run_id": "a527546ecfec4736", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.74644756317139, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbo